OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers discovered Chloe  
OL,4,AMitchell's remains in bins, court hears
OL,6,FThe 21-year-old's body parts were found
OL,7,Fin wheelie bins near Rainey's flat in  
OL,8,FBallymena on 11 June 2023, eight days  
OL,9,Fafter the prosecution says she was     
OL,10,Fmurdered by the defendant in his home. 
